This directory is a modified copy of the gpui_macos crate from Zed v1.28.1
(https://github.com/zed-industries/zed, crates/gpui_macos, commit e8bc16ace).
zyuapp changed it in 2026: the manifest stands alone; zoomed windows report
maximized bounds; mouse moves reach windows as AppKit routes them; windows
draw in the display's colour space; accessibility hit tests away from
pressable elements answer the window; GPUI_DRAW_OCCLUDED keeps covered
windows drawing.
